//// |  ESC  | LC(A) | LA(R) | LG(S) | LS(T) |  G   |                                       |  M   | RS(N) | RG(E) | LA(I) | RC(O) | BKSP |
//// |  SHFT |   Z   |   X   |   C   |   D   |  V   |     [     | DEL |   | DEL |     ]     |  K   |   H   |   ,   |   .   |   /   | SHFT |
////                         |       |       | RALT | RAISE_MOS | ENT |   | SPC | LOWER_MOS | RALT |       |       |
